00:52:08.791 --> 00:52:10.761
that biology uses to clean up our cells,

00:52:10.761 --> 00:52:15.454
to tidy up, get rid of old worn
out proteins and organelles.

00:52:15.454 --> 00:52:18.451
And it's involved in DNA repair,

00:52:18.451 --> 00:52:19.420
which is amazing.

00:52:19.420 --> 00:52:20.881
It's one of the reasons
that's been proposed

00:52:20.881 --> 00:52:23.970
why you'll see an increased risk

00:52:23.970 --> 00:52:25.492
of certain cancers in night shift workers,

00:52:25.492 --> 00:52:28.130
which make up something like 20%

00:52:28.130 --> 00:52:29.447
of the global workforce.

00:52:29.447 --> 00:52:34.447
So yeah I mean you tend to
become less insulin sensitive.

00:52:34.750 --> 00:52:36.716
Because insulin sensitivity
and energy metabolism,

00:52:36.716 --> 00:52:37.881
it's really,

00:52:37.881 --> 00:52:40.653
our hormones are oriented in a way

00:52:40.653 --> 00:52:44.186
