00:52:44.186 --> 00:52:45.998
when the light is out,
when it's light out.

00:52:45.998 --> 00:52:50.998
And we're just, you know,
evolution has anticipated

00:52:51.389 --> 00:52:52.955
that we're gonna be less active at night

