we tend to be more alert

00:53:04.642 --> 00:53:07.516
earlier in the day than
we are later in the day.

00:53:07.516 --> 00:53:09.020
That makes total sense.

00:53:09.020 --> 00:53:11.470
- Yeah, I know there's no
