00:54:29.473 --> 00:54:31.189
And these proteins are,

00:54:31.189 --> 00:54:32.510
they're fairly insensitive,

00:54:32.510 --> 00:54:34.700
but they respond to about 1,000 lux

00:54:34.700 --> 00:54:36.020
